<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43070" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτάζω</span></b> , aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤτασα</span> (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>examine, test,</i> mostly in compd. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξετάζω</span> (for which it is v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.62
			</span></i>, ap.<i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				96
			</span></i>), cf. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρετάζω</span></b>  ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀδικέοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					266
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτάζει</span> (etym. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				410d
			</span></i> ; freq. in <i><span class="en">
				LXX
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐτάζων καρδίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ch.</u>
					29.17
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτάζουσι</span> Polusap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				3.9.51
			</span></i> : aor. 1
			inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτάσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					1.460J.
				</span></i>
			 (prob. l.) : c. dupl. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤν με Μουσάων ἐτάσῃς χάριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.17
				</span></i>
			 (Tull. Laur.); <i>reveal, unmask,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				12.135
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				6.7
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>visit, try, afflict,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα μεγάλοις ἐτασμοῖς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ge.</u>
				12.17
			</span></i>. (Fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτός</span> (B) as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκιμάζω</span> fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόκιμος.</span>)</div>
